<!-- com.omniupdate.div label="maincontent" group="Everyone" button="707" --><!-- ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/maincontent.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/classes.txt" width="1000"/ --><p>&nbsp;</p>

~[com[27194 1 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"010c737f4f75cc888e7baa7feb60beb7":"No","e50e2b7b4162e86d86238d99470b3595":"","b97dfec6f8c76272a9e018ebb5f0e71d":"","677ee82b0548c66745888954018b7016":"centered","4f8e1b0b612e42aa1ff2655078463bcc":"No","5660fa1787542d62758bea4d92b583c9":"No","ce9444d0b080bdf2a3392ffffac92ec7":"ICM Degree Program Offerings"}}]]~

<table class="gallery-text" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Gallery Item - Text</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>The Interdisciplinary Computing and Methods (ICM) degree programs unite a strong foundation in computer science with focused study in business, criminology or social sciences. These programs prepare students to understand and shape how computing drives decision‑making, security and social impact. By integrating technical skills with domain knowledge, graduates are equipped for complex, interdisciplinary careers.</p>
<table class="image-grid">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Number of Images in Row <br />Options: 2, 3, or 4</th>
<td class="grid-number" width="50%" data-select-list="2, 3, 4">3</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Image</th>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Caption</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><a href="{{f:76379966}}"><img src="{{f:78390797}}" alt="{{f:73635003}}" width="490" height="328" /></a></td>
<td>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="{{f:78014068}}"><img src="{{f:78390792}}" alt="{{f:73635003}}" width="490" height="328" /></a></td>
<td>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="{{f:76379977}}"><img src="{{f:78390790}}" alt="{{f:73635003}}" width="490" height="328" /></a></td>
<td>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
