</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

~[com[27194 2 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"010c737f4f75cc888e7baa7feb60beb7":"No","e50e2b7b4162e86d86238d99470b3595":"","b97dfec6f8c76272a9e018ebb5f0e71d":"","677ee82b0548c66745888954018b7016":"centered","4f8e1b0b612e42aa1ff2655078463bcc":"No","5660fa1787542d62758bea4d92b583c9":"No","ce9444d0b080bdf2a3392ffffac92ec7":"Innovative Curriculum"}}]]~

<table class="gallery-text" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Gallery Item - Text</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Each program blends core computer science coursework with discipline‑specific study tailored to its field. Students in computer science and business explore computing alongside analytics, management and organizational systems. Computer science and criminology integrates computing with studies of crime, justice and cybersecurity. The social sciences program connects computational methods with social data, policy and human behavior, highlighting how technology informs society.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

~[com[27194 4 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"010c737f4f75cc888e7baa7feb60beb7":"No","e50e2b7b4162e86d86238d99470b3595":"","b97dfec6f8c76272a9e018ebb5f0e71d":"","677ee82b0548c66745888954018b7016":"centered","4f8e1b0b612e42aa1ff2655078463bcc":"No","5660fa1787542d62758bea4d92b583c9":"No","ce9444d0b080bdf2a3392ffffac92ec7":"Flexible Electives"}}]]~

<table class="gallery-text-image" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" colspan="2">Gallery Item - Text and Image <br />Image Dimensions - Width: 460 px, Height: 300 px* <br />* Recommended height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading Display. Accepted values: yes, no</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading-display" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="yes, no">no</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading" style="width: 50%;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur montes det</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Text</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-text" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Elective options allow students to tailor their interdisciplinary focus within each ICM pathway. Choose courses that deepen technical expertise, expand knowledge in your partner discipline or explore emerging areas where computing and society intersect. This flexibility supports customized academic and career goals, whether preparing for industry, graduate study or cross‑sector work.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-image" style="width: 50%;"><img src="{{f:74294402}}" alt="Alt Text" width="1177" height="815" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image Alignment. Accepted values: left, right</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-alignment" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="left, right">left</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

~[com[27194 3 5{ "version": 5, "data": {"010c737f4f75cc888e7baa7feb60beb7":"No","e50e2b7b4162e86d86238d99470b3595":"","b97dfec6f8c76272a9e018ebb5f0e71d":"","677ee82b0548c66745888954018b7016":"centered","4f8e1b0b612e42aa1ff2655078463bcc":"No","5660fa1787542d62758bea4d92b583c9":"No","ce9444d0b080bdf2a3392ffffac92ec7":"Integrated Projects"}}]]~

<table class="gallery-text" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">Gallery Item - Text</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Students apply their interdisciplinary learning through projects that connect computing with business challenges, criminal justice systems or social analysis. Capstone and project‑based experiences emphasize collaboration, real‑world problem‑solving and the practical application of computational methods within each discipline, demonstrating the value of integrated expertise in professional and academic settings.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
